## 6. Prioritized iteration backlog — the ordered plan

Run these as iteration subtasks on parent `6a07e0b7`. They are ordered by user-visible impact. Do not start lower items until the upper item is validated at both functional and visual levels.

1. **`iter-writes`** — wire end-to-end CRUD for tasks + projects. This is the biggest unlock. Agent scope: add Mojo `Create/Update/Delete/Move` mojoms per domain, C++ host implementations, sidecar SQLite-backed handlers, route dialog submits. Exit: user creates a project, creates 3 tasks, drags between columns, edits a task, deletes a task; all persist across relaunch. Screenshot proof.
2. **`iter-layout-tab-switch`** — LayoutMode auto-switch on tab type. Expose `TabSnapshot.type` via tabs.mojom. Tabbar JS calls `host.SetLayoutMode(kHome or kTaskDetail)` on tab switch. Exit: clicking the home tab vs. a task tab produces the right composition with no CLI flag. Screenshot proof.
3. **`iter-overlay-trigger`** — overlay mode reachable via Cmd+K / leaderboard button / shortcuts / ESC. Exit: no CLI flag needed to enter overlay. Screenshot proof.
4. **`iter-parity-electron-cdp`** — unblock Electron-side CDP port so the parity harness diffs fork vs. Electron pixel-by-pixel. Exit: `tools/parity/compare.js` produces a diff report per mode + region with real baselines. Pixel diff < 5% threshold per region.
5. **`iter-visual-parity`** — per-region pixel tune-up (typography, spacing, icons, borders, animations) until diff is < 2%. Iterate region-by-region.
6. **`iter-settings-full-tabs`** — drain the Providers/Panels/Data/MCP/Diagnostics/About deferred stubs. Each tab functional end-to-end.
7. **Phase 12 onboarding + tutorial.** After writes work (tutorial uses CRUD).
8. **Phase 13 file editor.** Independent surface.
9. **Phase 14 auxiliary windows.** Multi-Widget support.
10. **Phase 15 plugin panels.** Depends on auth flows being solid.
11. **Phase 17 keyboard/focus/zen + multi-panel home.** Polish pass.
12. **Phase 18 test retarget.** Gates on all surfaces solid.
13. **Phase 19 distribution.** Gates on Phase 18.

